flowchart TB
  Audio[Finalized temporary audio] --> Decode[FFmpeg: first 180 seconds / mono / 22050 Hz]
  Decode --> Beat[Validate float32 samples; librosa beat tracker]
  Beat --> Bounds{Valid samples / four beats / 30-300 BPM?}
  Bounds -->|no| Unknown[Unknown BPM]
  Bounds -->|yes| Bucket[Round estimate; select ten-BPM bucket]
  Bucket --> Folder[Example: 120-129 BPM]
